# ETS Website Review Automation System (Spec-Driven Design)

## 1. Overview

### 1.1 Purpose
The ETS Website Review Automation System converts a structured Excel input of website URLs into actionable Planner tasks, based on defined business rules, enabling efficient, controlled, and scalable content review workflows.

### 1.2 Problem Statement
Currently, website review tasks are manually created and tracked, leading to:
- Inefficiency in task creation
- Inconsistent tracking
- Lack of prioritization
- High manual effort for large URL sets

### 1.3 Solution Summary
This system:
- Reads URLs from an Excel file stored in SharePoint
- Applies conditional rules to determine task creation
- Generates structured Planner tasks
- Enables a scalable review workflow that can later integrate AI-based validation

