## 3. Data Contract

### 3.1 Source: Excel Table (SharePoint)

Data must be structured as a table.

| Column Name | Type | Required | Description |
|------------|------|----------|-------------|
| URL | String | Yes | Website page link |
| Upload in Planner | String / Boolean | Yes | Controls whether task is created |

---

## 4. Business Rules

### 4.1 Rule: Task Creation Gate

IF Upload in Planner = "Yes" THEN create Planner task ELSE skip row

---

### 4.2 Rule: Case Handling

To avoid mismatches:

Compare value using lowercase: toLower(value) = "yes"

---

### 4.3 Rule: Invalid Data Handling

| Condition | Action |
|----------|--------|
| Upload column is null | Skip |
| Upload column is blank | Skip |
| Value ≠ Yes | Skip |
| URL is blank | Skip |

---

