## 10. Future Enhancements (Phase 2+)

### 10.1 AI-Based Task Creation

Replace manual flag logic with:

IF AI detects issue THEN create Planner task

---

### 10.2 Duplicate Prevention

IF URL already exists in Planner THEN do not create duplicate task

---

### 10.3 Severity-Based Routing

IF Severity = High THEN assign immediately ELSE add to backlog

---

### 10.4 Auto-trigger

Change trigger from:

Manual

to:

When Excel file updated / uploaded

